# 🔍 3. Open Data Discovery (ODD) — The Visualization Hub

### 🧠 What It Does

**Open Data Discovery (ODD)** is a platform that connects to many tools (including OpenMetadata and OpenLineage) to **unify metadata in one visualization dashboard**.

Think of ODD as the **“metadata hub”** where you can see all your lineage, data quality, and ownership — even if it comes from multiple sources.

---

### 🧩 Core Features

| Feature | Description |
|----------|-------------|
| Metadata Aggregation | Pulls metadata from catalogs, pipelines, and quality tools. |
| Lineage Graph | Interactive graph linking datasets, jobs, and dashboards. |
| Search & Discovery | Search across all systems. |
| Data Quality Integration | Works with Great Expectations. |
| Unified API | Exposes metadata via API. |

---

### ⚙️ How ODD Works

```
Airflow / dbt / OpenLineage / OpenMetadata
        ↓
ODD Collectors (extract metadata)
        ↓
ODD API Server
        ↓
ODD UI (interactive dashboard)
```

You can use ODD as a **visual layer on top of OpenMetadata + OpenLineage**.

---

# ⚖️ Combined Comparison

| Feature | OpenLineage | OpenMetadata | Open Data Discovery |
|----------|--------------|---------------|----------------------|
| **Purpose** | Lineage standard | Metadata catalog + governance | Metadata visualization hub |
| **Primary Focus** | Data movement | Discovery, governance | Aggregation, visualization |
| **Lineage Depth** | Job/run-level | Table/column-level | Cross-tool graph |
| **Governance** | None | Full (tags, owners, quality) | Minimal |
| **Integrations** | Airflow, dbt, Spark | 70+ connectors | All major tools |
| **Discovery UI** | Basic | Advanced | Very strong (visual) |
| **Best For** | Engineering lineage | Full metadata management | Unified view across tools |

---

# 🧭 The Ideal Stack — How They Work Together

Here’s the **best architecture** if you use all three:

```
Airflow / dbt / Spark → OpenLineage → emits lineage
                     ↓
          OpenMetadata → catalogs + governance
                     ↓
         Open Data Discovery → visualization + search
```

### ✅ In short
- **OpenLineage** → Captures how data moves.  
- **OpenMetadata** → Manages and catalogs all metadata.  
- **Open Data Discovery** → Displays and unifies everything visually.

